# 2. The final product model

```text
Directory layer
  → unclaimed vendor discovery

Verified merchant layer
  → approved profile, menu, hours, operations

Ordering layer
  → customer WhatsApp/website ordering

Merchant operations layer
  → WhatsApp + portal order acceptance

Dispatch layer
  → active driver and zone coverage

Payment layer
  → COD or approved provider payment

AI layer
  → interpretation, extraction, recommendations, support

Trust layer
  → consent, privacy, security, audit, refunds, support
```

The platform should not activate all features at once. Each layer depends on the previous layer being reliable.

