# 7. Final recommendation

Alo King has covered the major strategic questions. The project is not missing another broad business idea. It is missing the transition from strategy to controlled implementation.

The correct next move is:

```text
freeze the product decisions
→ create API/event contracts
→ lock the Supabase/RLS model
→ implement reliable order operations
→ run one-zone pilot
→ measure failures
→ correct the system
→ expand carefully
```

Do not add more AI providers, mobile applications, nationwide zones, loyalty complexity, or autonomous campaigns until the first zone demonstrates reliable fulfilment.

> **Alo King is ready to move from planning into implementation and pilot execution.**
